  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You exhale a beam of soul-shattering lightning, in imitation of the technique used by the <strong>Weeping Dragon</strong>.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong> and make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check, resisted by the target's <strong>Resilience</strong>.</p><p>The target takes <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the difference in successes.</p><p>Additionally, the target creature is <strong>Stunned</strong> until the start of your next turn, as its body is wracked with agonizing pain.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain this effect.</p>",
